<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Project Report</title>
    <style>
        @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
        .page {
            width: 794px; height: 1123px;
            padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
            overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
            position: relative;
            font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
        }
        .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans", Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        }
        .header-title {
            font-size: 24pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        .header-subtitle {
            font-size: 14pt;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .body-text {
            font-size: 11pt;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        .image-container {
            margin: 20px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .image-container img {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
        }
        .two-column-layout {
            display: flex;
            gap: 50px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .column {
            flex: 1;
        }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 14pt;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-top: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .list-item {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .process-step {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .process-step-icon {
            width: 50px;
            height: 50px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #ccc;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 15px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }
        .process-step-content h4 {
            margin: 0 0 5px 0;
            font-size: 12pt;
        }
        .process-step-content p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .flowchart-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }
        .flowchart-step {
            text-align: center;
            flex: 1;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        .flowchart-step-box {
            border: 2px solid #333;
            padding: 10px;
            margin: 5px 0;
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .footer {
            position: absolute;
            bottom: 50px;
            left: 60px;
            right: 60px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-size: 9pt;
            color: #555;
        }
        .contact-info-block {
            width: 30%;
        }
        .contact-info-block h3 {
            font-size: 11pt;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .contact-info-block p {
            margin: 2px 0;
        }
        .logo {
            font-size: 20pt;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <div class="header-title">Project Report</div>
        <div class="header-subtitle">Lightning in a bottle? Solar power in a chip</div>
        <div style="font-size: 12pt;">Silicon purification process "under control" by <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span></div>
    </div>

    <div class="image-container">
        <img src="placeholder_solar_panel.jpg" alt="Solar Panel Array">
    </div>

    <div class="two-column-layout">
        <div class="column">
            <div class="body-text">
                <p>The country known as <span data-field="country_name">{{ country_name }}</span> and the <span data-field="region_name">{{ region_name }}</span> is leading the way in creating technologies that aid in harnessing the power of the sun.</p>
                <p>In its <span data-field="investment_amount">{{ investment_amount }}</span> (<span data-field="investment_currency">{{ investment_currency }}</span>) facility, <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span> has embarked on industrializing the production of solar-grade silicon to be used in solar power cells capable of generating renewable energy for more than 30 years.</p>
                <p>The <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span> delivered electrical high/ low voltage solutions to the total plant, including the <span data-field="system_name">{{ system_name }}</span> solution.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="column">
            <div class="body-text">
                <p>While the world's energy needs are growing, energy production must turn renewable, to avoid global warming. Reducing carbon dioxide emissions and doing so by using energy more efficiently are the two key elements in an energy policy for the 21st century.</p>
                <p>Solar panels made from silicon are increasingly transforming solar rays into energy for people all over the world. Indeed, harnessing energy from the sun is a key element in the Sahara and Middle Eastern deserts is enough to meet the energy needs of the continents of Europe, North Africa and Middle East. Making solar power a more competitive energy source is an important step towards creating a sustainable world.</p>
                <p>The most critical component in solar cells is highly purified silicon. Elkem Solar has been the world's leading producer of silicon since 1970. It has again shown Norwegian metallurgical expertise with its new plant in Kristiansand.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <div style="font-size: 16pt; font-weight: bold;">In this new factory, energy consumption is 75% lower than in a similar factory with traditional technology.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="image-container">
        <img src="placeholder_factory_image.jpg" alt="Factory Interior">
    </div>

    <div class="two-column-layout">
        <div class="column">
            <div class="section-title">Breakthrough technology</div>
            <div class="body-text">
                <p>High-purity silicon is needed in making photovoltaic and solar cells. However, the solar market has seen a limited supply of such silicon. Elkem Solar addressed this need by building a new facility in Kristiansand to produce 6,000 metric tons of high-purity silicon for solar cell panels a year. The plant became operational in July 2009.</p>
                <p>In this new factory, energy consumption is 75% lower than in a similar factory with traditional technology. It accomplishes this by using ABB's comprehensive automation and power solution, integrated on the common System 800xA platform.</p>
                <p>The new plant utilizes a new and energy saving metallurgical process for producing solar-grade silicon, Elkem Solar Silicon&reg;, which is a high-purity silicon with low carbon dioxide levels.</p>
                <p>The new production line consists of five independent process steps for purifying silicon. System 800xA provides precise control of two of the processes, while ensuring safe and reliable operations and optimizing energy efficiency.</p>
                <p><span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span> control and safety solutions for energy efficiency</p>
                <p>The System 800xA platform is a comprehensive automation platform, ABB optimizes the design and performance of the plant, while ensuring safe and reliable operations and energy efficiency. Plus, there are the additional benefits of reduced maintenance, engineering and overall lifecycle costs.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="column">
            <div class="section-title">Scope of the project</div>
            <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="scope_item_1">{{ scope_item_1 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="scope_item_2">{{ scope_item_2 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="scope_item_3">{{ scope_item_3 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="scope_item_4">{{ scope_item_4 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="scope_item_5">{{ scope_item_5 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="scope_item_6">{{ scope_item_6 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="scope_item_7">{{ scope_item_7 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="scope_item_8">{{ scope_item_8 }}</span></li>
                <li class="list-item"><span data-field="scope_item_9">{{ scope_item_9 }}</span></li>
            </ul>
            <div class="section-title" style="margin-top: 40px;">Note:</div>
            <div class="body-text" style="font-size: 10pt;">
                <p>We reserve the right to make technical changes to the products or modify the contents of this document without prior notice. With regard to purchase orders, the agreed particulars shall prevail. <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span> does not assume any responsibility for any errors or incomplete information in this document.</p>
                <p>We reserve all rights to this document and the information contained therein. The reproduction or distribution of this document is prohibited without <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span>'s prior written permission.</p>
                <p>Copyright 2012 <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span>.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
    <div class="section-title" style="text-align: center;">Integrated process automation maximizes Elkem's capacity and energy efficiency</div>
    <div class="body-text" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
        <p>The realization of high-efficiency solar cells with low process energy consumption is the most important technical issue for the major solar cell manufacturers, including Elkem.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="body-text">
        <p>To this end, Elkem developed the five-step purification process for silicon, produced with <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span> control solutions including System 800xA controlling Steps 1 and 3 of the process line.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="section-title">Elkem Solar Silicon production process</div>

    <div class="flowchart-container">
        <div class="flowchart-step">
            <div class="process-step-icon">1</div>
            <div class="flowchart-step-box">
                <span data-field="process_step_1_name">{{ process_step_1_name }}</span>
                <p><span data-field="process_step_1_desc">{{ process_step_1_desc }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="process_step_1_desc_2">{{ process_step_1_desc_2 }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 20pt; margin: 0 10px;">&rarr;</div>
        <div class="flowchart-step">
            <div class="process-step-icon">2</div>
            <div class="flowchart-step-box">
                <span data-field="process_step_2_name">{{ process_step_2_name }}</span>
                <p><span data-field="process_step_2_desc">{{ process_step_2_desc }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="process_step_2_desc_2">{{ process_step_2_desc_2 }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 20pt; margin: 0 10px;">&rarr;</div>
        <div class="flowchart-step">
            <div class="process-step-icon">3</div>
            <div class="flowchart-step-box">
                <span data-field="process_step_3_name">{{ process_step_3_name }}</span>
                <p><span data-field="process_step_3_desc">{{ process_step_3_desc }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 20pt; margin: 0 10px;">&rarr;</div>
        <div class="flowchart-step">
            <div class="process-step-icon">4</div>
            <div class="flowchart-step-box">
                <span data-field="process_step_4_name">{{ process_step_4_name }}</span>
                <p><span data-field="process_step_4_desc">{{ process_step_4_desc }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div style="font-size: 20pt; margin: 0 10px;">&rarr;</div>
        <div class="flowchart-step">
            <div class="process-step-icon">5</div>
            <div class="flowchart-step-box">
                <span data-field="process_step_5_name">{{ process_step_5_name }}</span>
                <p><span data-field="process_step_5_desc">{{ process_step_5_desc }}</span></p>
                <p><span data-field="process_step_5_desc_2">{{ process_step_5_desc_2 }}</span></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="body-text" style="margin-top: 40px;">
        <p>Lower production costs, equivalent product quality and less energy consumption – this is the picture Elkem foresees for the solar industry. <span data-field="company_name">{{ company_name }}</span> shares this vision. And together, we are one step closer to making this a reality.</p>
    </div>
</div>

